## <summary>
##	LamaDist local policy module: LamaDist-specific domains and file
##	contexts that refpolicy-targeted does not already cover (see the
##	companion lamadist.te).
## </summary>

# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# refpolicy's build requires a .if for every module: Rules.modular
# assembles all_interfaces.conf from every module's .if, and
# support/sedoctool.py reads the <summary> above when it regenerates
# modules.conf on `make conf`.  lamadist exports no interfaces of its
# own -- it only adds raw allow rules in lamadist.te -- so this file
# carries just the module summary and defines no interfaces.
